# Formspree form id — the part after /f/ in your endpoint URL.
# Example: endpoint https://formspree.io/f/xldbgkqw  ->  id is "xldbgkqw"
#
# Not a secret: Formspree endpoints are public by design, which is why this is
# NEXT_PUBLIC_. Spam is handled by the honeypot in ContactForm.tsx.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Create a form at https://formspree.io (free tier: 50 submissions/month)
#   2. Copy .env.example to .env.local and fill in the id below
#   3. Add the same variable to the Vercel project: Settings > Environment Variables
#
# If this is unset, the contact form shows an error with a mailto: fallback
# rather than falsely reporting success.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
